{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>完善選舉制度後，第二屆選委會界別分組選舉開始投票。</p><p></p><p>投票站早上9時起開放。保安局局長鄧炳強在開始投票之前，先到九龍公園體育館投票站巡視，又與在場的民安隊員傾談。</p><p>之後轉到另一個票站，灣仔港灣道體育館視察。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTION.MORNING-1000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DiclKNVRro1795313045.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>不少候選人的助選團在站外拉票，有選民一早來到投票。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTION.MORNING-1000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026cJVHHdeHOy1795313204.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>投票到傍晚6時結束。全港共有7個票站，分布在灣仔、尖沙咀及荃灣等地，亦有兩個位於警署及監獄的專用票站。5,700多人合資格投票，選民要用票站提供的筆，填滿候選人所屬的橢圓圈。投票時不可選擇多於所屬界別分組的席位數目。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:22:18.477914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T01:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T22:57:33.060838+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T03:15:39.349057+00:00","content_hash":"6ec0be918313808a6b93edb3e5796b6e3d1c094ce40dbc397d17ca0669ad8734","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T03:22:18.477914+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}